
units real
atom_style full
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style opls
improper_style harmonic
boundary p p p
pair_style lj/cut/tip4p/long 4 5 2 2 0.105 12.0
kspace_style pppm/tip4p 1.0e-5
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.83
pair_modify mix arithmetic

read_data topology.data
include parameters.inc
write_dump all atom prod.lammpstrj

group graphene type 1
group water type 4 5
group ethanol type 6 7 8 9 10 11 12
group fluid type 4 5 6 7 8 9 10 11 12 

fix myshk water shake 1.0e-5 200 0 b 2 a 2
fix mynph all nph x 1 1 1000 y 1 1 1000 z 1 1 1000

compute tfluid fluid temp
fix mynvt1 fluid temp/berendsen 300 300 100
fix_modify mynvt1 temp tfluid

compute tgraphene graphene temp
fix mynvt2 graphene temp/berendsen 300 300 100
fix_modify mynvt2 temp tgraphene

fix mymom1 fluid momentum 1000 linear 1 1 1
fix mymom2 graphene momentum 1000 linear 1 1 1

thermo 100

run 50000
write_data eq.data

thermo 2500
dump dp1 all xtc 2500 prod.xtc

run 60000000

write_data eq.data
write_dump all atom prod.lammpstrj
